Presents electron theory, magnetism, Ohm's Law, resistance, current flow, instruments for electrical measurement, A.C. motors, power distribution controls and their application. Part II of II. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 2 hours. Total 4 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
